amous, yet absent mother just passed, so Lisa needs a big change. She reunites with her best friend Luka, who found success in America but is struggling to find his own prince charming. Luka embarks on a mission to give Lisa a fresh start by creating a profile for her on a dating website."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Lisa décide de se donner une nouvelle chance en amour en quittant Paris pour Los Angeles. Ses enfants ont déserté le nid familial et sa mère célèbre, qui a été très absente durant sa vie, vient juste de mourir : Lisa a donc besoin d’un nouveau départ !","tagline":"Il n'est jamais trop tard pour changer de vie."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tbfifGlaTxaXwRkWMPGcVYHnf5m.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2HyGLxZ87t0T3Rgzeg15kN3yFYR.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"enrichment":{"status":"ready","hasMissingEpisodeMetadata":false}}
